                category  : See_Landmarks &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.jaivilasmuseum.org/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A former residential palace turned museum of Scindias. Contains the world's largest chandelier as well as many diverse collections of antiques and gadgets. &lt;br&gt;
